# The archive and the generated store are compared byte for byte — `npm run ingest` must
# reproduce app/observations.generated.ts exactly, and a fetcher rewrites its batch only when a
# value actually moved. Git's Windows default (core.autocrlf=true) checks these out as CRLF while
# the scripts write LF, so every run would produce a whitespace-only diff and the weekly refresh
# would open a pull request each time claiming a leaderboard had changed.
#
# The maintaining agent runs on Windows. Normalise everything to LF in the working tree.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touched by hand and never diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
